{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>《玫瑰戰爭》第7集劇情大暴走，姚子羚捲入小三疑雲後於深夜慘遭兩名黑衣男伏擊受傷送院。楊茜堯在病榻前強勢介入並承諾代為出手對付幕後黑手，同時更著手推動揭露亡故往事專題。這場血腥襲擊背後牽扯出天誠娛樂內部更加錯綜複雜權力暗戰。</p>\n<h2>姚子羚深夜遇襲衣衫不整</h2>\n<p>林夏薇飾演黎綺雲得知鳳儀過往故意隱瞞爆料，直指鳳儀多年來留在身邊是一直「想上位、想取代我」，令兩人深藏已久猜忌徹底浮出水面。鳳儀其後於夜裡街頭突遭兩名戴口罩黑衣男左右夾擊，她被逼至牆角無法掙脫，混亂間額頭受創流下鮮血。畫面可見鳳儀披頭散髮且神情驚恐張嘴叫喊，隨後更因傷勢嚴重被送往醫院留醫，臉頰明顯留有瘀傷及手腕纏滿繃帶。</p>\n<h2>楊茜堯病房霸氣護航 為姚子羚反擊埋伏線</h2>\n<p>鳳儀遇襲後躺在病床上，額頭貼着紗布，臉上瘀傷仍清晰可見。夏無雙（楊茜堯飾）親自到醫院探望，坐在床邊向她承諾：「我幫你去對付你唔敢得罪嘅人。」一句說話盡顯強硬態度，亦令人關注鳳儀究竟忌憚誰。無雙此時出手相助，會否令鳳儀願意吐露更多內情，成為反擊的關鍵，為後續劇情留下懸念。</p>\n<h2>姚子羚遇襲疑團未解 幕後主腦身分引揣測</h2>\n<p>第7集預告曝光後迅速引發廣泛迴響，不少觀眾將焦點放在襲擊事件幕後主腦身份上。大批網民紛紛在討論區留言推測劇情走向，有人直指「林夏薇個角色嫌疑最大」，亦有觀眾被楊茜堯強大氣場震撼，大讚「楊茜堯演技一流」及「期待真相大白嗰刻」。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179483364705398176_18704918106afafcef9bee0.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"VS--plyr-43’03”.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179483364705398176_18704918106afafcef9bee0.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179483364792650466_10948513126afafcf059cb4.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"VS--plyr-43’07”.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179483364792650466_10948513126afafcf059cb4.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179483364921715844_7975425766afafcf19ecb5.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"VS--plyr-43’08” (2).jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179483364921715844_7975425766afafcf19ecb5.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179483365024584816_6048483646afafcf2a29d0.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"VS--plyr-43’07” (1).jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179483365024584816_6048483646afafcf2a29d0.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179483365124957532_9656147846afafcf3a097b.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"‘.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179483365124957532_9656147846afafcf3a097b.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179483365185641655_3726245296afafcf432f6c.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"VS--plyr-43’17” (1).jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179483365185641655_3726245296afafcf432f6c.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179483365246829669_955829176afafcf4ef31f.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"VS--plyr-43’17”.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179483365246829669_955829176afafcf4ef31f.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179483365325345089_19192804206afafcf5a964a.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"b201f4ba-b537-41de-92ce-050fbf400cb8.png/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179483365325345089_19192804206afafcf5a964a.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T13:53:28.976456+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":876,"images":8,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T13:30:20+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T15:13:13.441879+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T13:46:59.131418+00:00","content_hash":"567267ac3e011e6087593b45655b284c48857ce4708ef6c13a89c7dadbdb147e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}